{"availability":"available","full":"RyvelTS/rupakode-app","name":"rupakode-app","description":"RupaKode is a modern web application designed to boost developer productivity by combining two essential tools in one platform: a color palette generator and a conventional commit message generator. With RupaKode, developers can quickly create harmonious color schemes for UI/UX design and generate structured, standards-compliant Git commit messages","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-06-20T22:28:50Z","updated":"2026-07-27T10:24:26Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://rupakode.netlify.app/","topics":["angular","angular-material","netlify","tailwindcss"],"demo":"https://rupakode.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:51.001Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:51.001Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:51.001Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:28:51.001Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Angular"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Memperindah Tampilan, Merapikan Riwayat: Solusi Komprehensif untuk Developer","RupaKode adalah aplikasi web inovatif yang lahir dari kolaborasi dalam program Hacktiv8 x IBM SkillsBuild - Code Generation & Optimization. Proyek ini dirancang untuk membantu developer modern bekerja lebih cerdas, efisien, dan kreatif—semua langsung dari browser Anda, tanpa biaya, tanpa login, dan tanpa hambatan!","RupaKode menggabungkan dua alat esensial dalam satu platform ringan: generator palet warna UI/UX dan generator pesan commit Git berbasis konvensi. Dengan antarmuka yang intuitif dan responsif, RupaKode siap menjadi sahabat produktivitas harian Anda."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RyvelTS/rupakode-app/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"bf0c876b730bbfbc4648806977629370505674d09e8d9152e5b3e875277463ad","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:51.154Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:51.154Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatI